---
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: /books/
title: "All Books — Made Out of Clay Productions"
description: "Browse ten full-color picture books by Isaiah Hartwell across four series, including nine available titles and a free Titus preview."
schemaBooks: true
breadcrumbs:
  - { name: "Home", url: "/" }
  - { name: "Books", url: "/books/" }
---
{% from "partials/book-card.njk" import bookCard %}
<section class="page-head">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h1>All Books</h1>
    <p>Ten print picture books across four print series for ages {{ site.printAgeRange }}. Nine are available on Amazon; <em>Titus and the Lions</em> is coming soon with a free preview.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section-compact" id="find-by-need">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="catalog-start content-panel">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Not sure where to begin?</p>
        <h2>Start with the feeling in front of you.</h2>
        <p>Choose calm for a noisy or full day, belonging for an affirming identity-first story, courage for a new challenge, or faith for an explicitly Christian read-aloud.</p>
      </div>
      <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="https://club.madeoutofclayprod.com/">Try a free digital story first</a>
    </div>

    <div class="catalog-controls" aria-labelledby="filter-heading">
      <h2 id="filter-heading">Filter the catalog</h2>
      <div class="filter-fields">
        <label>Series
          <select id="catalog-series">
            <option value="all">All print series</option>
            {% for s in series %}<option value="{{ s.slug }}">{{ s.name }}</option>{% endfor %}
          </select>
        </label>
        <label>Theme or need
          <select id="catalog-theme">
            <option value="all">All themes</option>
            <option value="calm">Big feelings and calm</option>
            <option value="neurodiversity">Neurodiversity and belonging</option>
            <option value="courage">Courage and trying new things</option>
            <option value="faith">Faith-based</option>
            <option value="bedtime">Bedtime</option>
            <option value="sensory">Sensory needs</option>
            <option value="classroom">Classroom conversations</option>
          </select>
        </label>
        <button class="btn btn-secondary" type="button" id="catalog-reset">Clear filters</button>
      </div>
      <p id="catalog-count" class="catalog-count" aria-live="polite">Showing all ten print titles.</p>
    </div>

    <p class="purchase-disclosure"><strong>Affiliate disclosure:</strong> The Buy on Amazon buttons are affiliate links. As an Amazon Associate I earn from qualifying purchases; you pay the same price. <a href="/affiliate-disclosure/">Details.</a></p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section-alt">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="book-grid catalog-grid" id="catalog-grid">
    {% for book in books %}
      {%- set s = lookups.seriesBySlug[book.series] -%}
      <div class="catalog-item" id="{{ book.slug }}" data-series="{{ book.series }}" data-themes="{{ book.themes | join(' ') }}{% if book.series == 'just-the-way-you-are' %} neurodiversity classroom{% endif %}{% if book.series == 'titus-the-lamb' %} faith{% endif %}{% if 'courage' in book.themes or 'self-advocacy' in book.themes or 'identity' in book.themes %} classroom{% endif %}">
        {{ bookCard(book, site, s.name) }}
      </div>
    {% endfor %}
    </div>
    <p class="catalog-empty" id="catalog-empty" hidden>No books match those filters yet. Try clearing one filter.</p>
  </div>
</section>

{% include "partials/faq.njk" %}
